  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"d01f68a5-9cbb-c440-a0ec-fd85c9723e48"],
 " ",
 "draws each array of the hypermatrix hm as cubes in space, in canonical \
order."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"ab9c8751-c88e-5c48-adae-0b2da6a8f856"],

